// Deal or Force - what three regions are really called.
//
// The map source draws the Siachen Glacier, the UN buffer zone on Cyprus and the Guantanamo
// base as countries of their own, and names the one region inside each after something else:
// the glacier's region was "Kashmir" (which is four other regions of the map), the buffer
// zone's was "Northern Cyprus" (which is a country north of it), and the base's was the US
// Navy's abbreviation for itself. While each sat inside a "country" carrying the right name
// nobody read the region's. They are regions of India, Cyprus and Cuba now
// (common/country_merges), and a region is read by its own name.
//
// Read after 00_states.json, so these three lines win over the generated roster; a mod that
// prefers another spelling writes a later file with the same keys.
{
  "99_x06": { "name": "Siachen Glacier" },
  "99_x04": { "name": "UN Buffer Zone" },
  "99_x13": { "name": "Guantanamo Bay" }
}
